id=tb330fu_notelephony
name=TB330FU Disable Telephony
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=levin
description=Disables cellular/telephony on the WiFi-only Lenovo Tab M11 (TB330FU) GSI. Marks all android.hardware.telephony* features unavailable, so SIM/mobile/calling UI is removed and com.android.phone stops crash-looping. Reboot after install.
